31,1,1,talk,Mio,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I hope no one had any scary dreams!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Good morning. I'm wondering if the Seer has any information to share.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I have a small piece of knowledge. Kenji is human.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Whoa! @Jonathan, you're the Seer? That's so cool! Thanks for checking me!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A bold revelation so early. Jonathan, I appreciate your transparency, though it does make you a target.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mio,,"Wow, Jonathan is the Seer! That's amazing! Now we just have to find the wolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If Jonathan is the Seer, we should protect him. But we must consider if he's lying.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your caution, Misaki. Truth is often a quiet thing.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I trust Jonathan! He's a nice guy! Let's listen to him!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic suggests that if Jonathan is the werewolf, he's attempting to build trust quickly. A classic maneuver.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, you're so suspicious! Why are you always doubting everyone?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
