43,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,It is alright. Doubt is a natural part of the process.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Come on, Benjamin! Let's be positive! I'm sure Jonathan is telling the truth!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,My apologies if I seem cynical. I simply prefer to weigh all possibilities before committing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mio,,I think we should trust Jonathan for now! Let's look for the wolf elsewhere!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Since we have no other leads, I'll trust the Seer's word for this turn.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Thank you. I believe we should observe the others a bit more.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Kenji,,Yeah! Let's just be careful! I'm with Jonathan!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Very well. If the consensus is to trust Jonathan, I shall follow suit for the moment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
